ine/godot/issues/101930","id":2608047031,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bc6O3","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-22T19:06:19Z","updated_at":"2025-01-22T19:06:19Z","body":"So this is specific to CI, my bad, the code generation should probably be changed here, the question is if it should generate handlers etc. for a deprecated signal or not, and if it should I assume it should be adding warning supressions appropriately\n\nHas there not been any other deprecated signals so far?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2608047031/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2608050073","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101930#issuecomment-2608050073","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101930","id":2608050073,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bc6-Z","user":{"login":"RedMser","id":5117197,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMTcxOTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5117197?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser","html_url":"https://github.com/RedMser","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-22T19:08:03Z","updated_at":"2025-01-22T19:08:03Z","body":"> Has there not been any other deprecated signals so far?\n\nThere are `EditorPlugin.project_settings_changed` and `Resource.setup_local_to_scene_requested` but their generated code does not include the `Trampoline` function, so they don't use any deprecated things.\nProbably different scenario because `SceneTree` is a singleton? I'm not a C# user so I'm just guessing :D","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2608050073/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2608054944","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101930#issuecomment-2608054944","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101930","id":2608054944,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bc8Kg","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-22T19:09:36Z","updated_at":"2025-01-22T19:09:36Z","body":"Then it looks like we're just missing the correct code in code generation, *or* it is handled safely for those signals and it just doesn't work for singletons for some reason\n\nI'd suggest someone with C# knowledge should dig through the code generator and see\n\nOr just generate the C# code and see what those signal handlers output, they might just be adding some magic that this case just doesn't because of some edge case","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2608054944/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2611358269","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101930#issuecomment-2611358269","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101930","id":2611358269,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bpio9","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-24T01:35:11Z","updated_at":"2025-01-24T01:35:11Z","body":"The `Trampoline` function is generated when the signal has parameters, it's not really related to singletons. It just so happens that both `EditorPlugin.project_settings_changed` and `Resource.setup_local_to_scene_requested` are parameterless so they don't generate a `Trampoline` function[^1].\n\nThe `Trampoline` function is just a private implementation detail, it's generated to serve as a bridge between the C++ signal and the C# event. So you could say it's part of the code generated to implement the C# event that corresponds to a signal, if that signal is deprecated I think it makes sense to deprecate the `Trampoline` function as well, thus silencing the warning as suggested.\n\nI went ahead and created a PR to do that: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101970\n\n[^1]: The main purpose of the `Trampoline` function is to marshal the parameters from C++ objects into C# objects, so when the signal has no parameters, we don't need a `Trampoline` function.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2611358269/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]